rs, mostly including the children and wives. Ebisu attempts to rally everyones' spirits together in the event that rogue ninja should attack the village while their shinobi families are away at war, but the mothers scoff and claim that they will protect the village as they always have while their husbands fought. Suddenly Konohamaru is approached by several children, each claiming to have seen terrifying rogue ninja roaming the east and west forests outside Konoha. He tries to recruit his classmates into hunting them down, but they refuse to beleive him. Konohamaru investigates the area alone with Moegi and Udon, only to find a traveling circus troupe in the forest instead of rogue ninja. Heading back, Konohamaru is again alerted that people are attacking the village on the west side, and this time, the rumors are true...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-09-27","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":6.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jn9bBgoCtmmbbyzrNFWw2tT8CMR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jn9bBgoCtmmbbyzrNFWw2tT8CMR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/13/episode/281"},{"id":"761753","seasonNumber":13,"episodeNumber":282,"title":{"value":"La coppia più forte","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tsunade and the Raikage arrive to prevent Naruto and Killer Bee from joining the battle. But the two Kage fail to convince the Jinchuriki to turn back, forcing the Raikage to use extreme force.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2012-10-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":23,"rating":7.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cFmJrGnbLSEUIgdpoBrwBKtmHBB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cFmJrGnbLSEUIgdpoBrwBKtmHBB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/31910/season/13/episode/282"},{"id":"761756","seasonNumber":13,"episodeNumber":283,"title":{"value":"I due 